class=\"infobox-navbar\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1374427404\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239400231\" /><div class=\"navbar plainlinks hlist navbar-mini\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:DYKbox\" title=\"Template:DYKbox\"><abbr title=\"View this template\">v</abbr></a></li><li class=\"nv-talk\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template_talk:DYKbox\" title=\"Template talk:DYKbox\"><abbr title=\"Discuss this template\">t</abbr></a></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:EditPage/Template:DYKbox\" title=\"Special:EditPage/Template:DYKbox\"><abbr title=\"Edit this template\">e</abbr></a></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Hooks\">Hooks</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:Did_you_know&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Hooks\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"dyk-img\" style=\"float: right; margin-left: 0.5em;\">\n<div class=\"thumbinner mp-thumb\" style=\"background: transparent; color: inherit; border: none; padding: 0; max-width: 121px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Viburnum_odoratissimum_var_awabuki2.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Viburnum awabuki hedge\"><img alt=\"Viburnum awabuki hedge\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Viburnum_odoratissimum_var_awabuki2.jpg/250px-Viburnum_odoratissimum_var_awabuki2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"163\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1712\" data-file-height=\"2304\" /></a></span><div class=\"thumbcaption\" style=\"padding: 0.25em 0; word-wrap: break-word;\"><i>Viburnum awabuki</i> hedge</div></div></div>\n<ul><li>... that the species name of <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Viburnum_awabuki\" title=\"Viburnum awabuki\">Viburnum awabuki</a></b></i> <i>(pictured)</i> is derived from a Japanese word for its propensity to blow bubbles when exposed to fire?</li>\n<li>... that the opening song to the mahjong anime <i><a href=\"/wiki/Pon_no_Michi\" title=\"Pon no Michi\">Pon no Michi</a></i> was sung by <b><a href=\"/wiki/Kana_Nakada\" title=\"Kana Nakada\">a real-life professional mahjong player</a></b>?</li>\n<li>... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Sun_Pictures\" title=\"Sun Pictures\">Sun Pictures</a></b> released nearly 20 films between 2008 and 2010, then slowed sharply after a change of government in <a href=\"/wiki/Tamil_Nadu\" title=\"Tamil Nadu\">Tamil Nadu</a>?</li>\n<li>... that <i>The Art Newspaper</i> described the art of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Heba_Zagout\" title=\"Heba Zagout\">Heba Zagout</a></b> as \"steeped in Palestinian culture and folklore\"?</li>\n<li>... that, at one point during the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Second_Intermediate_Period_of_Egypt\" title=\"Second Intermediate Period of Egypt\">Second Intermediate Period</a></b>, ancient Egypt might have had three ruling dynasties at the same time?</li>\n<li>... that Swiss photographer <b><a href=\"/wiki/Albert_Steiner\" title=\"Albert Steiner\">Albert Steiner</a></b> was captured by Italian border guards and held for three weeks while on a military reconnaissance mission?</li>\n<li>... that Prince performed \"<b><a href=\"/wiki/Purple_Rain_(song)\" title=\"Purple Rain (song)\">Purple Rain</a></b>\" during the Super Bowl XLI halftime show under pouring rain and purple lights?</li>\n<li>... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Santiphab_Phomvihane\" title=\"Santiphab Phomvihane\">Santiphab Phomvihane</a></b> is the son of a former president of Laos, the brother of a former <a href=\"/wiki/National_Assembly_of_Laos\" title=\"National Assembly of Laos\">National Assembly</a> president, and the brother of the country's foreign minister?</li>\n<li>... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Pest_control_of_cockchafers\" title=\"Pest control of cockchafers\">beetles were collected and killed</a></b> after failing to comply with a court order?</li></ul>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1374427404\" /><div class=\"hlist dyk-footer noprint\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; text-align: right;\">\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:Did_you_know_archive\" title=\"Wikipedia:Did you know archive\">Archive</a></b></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Help:Your_first_article\" title=\"Help:Your first article\">Start a new article</a></b></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know\" title=\"Template talk:Did you know\">Nominate an article</a></b></li></ul>\n</div>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.codfw.main‐5f6d9f959b‐stlbm\nCached time: 20260929013518\nCache expiry: 1802\nCache expiry source: Module:Time_ago (formatDate)\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.135 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.237 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1115/1000000\nRevision size: 2002/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 71228/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6206/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/100\nExpensive parser function count: 9/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28831/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.068/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 4519023/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  209.175      1 -total\n 85.60%  179.048      1 Template:Did_you_know/Clear/header\n 58.54%  122.444      2 Template:Mbox\n 57.27%  119.789      1 Template:DYK-Refresh\n 22.75%   47.590      1 User:Theleekycauldron/Templates/DYK_queue_backlog\n 17.40%   36.397      1 Template:Quote_box\n 13.07%   27.334      1 Template:Navbar\n 10.83%   22.660      1 Template:Ifempty\n  9.70%   20.294      1 Template:DYKbox\n  9.19%   19.223      1 Templa